From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 21:38:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER (tools 0159): F5's build in a window of its own,
 big
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1003: "請你用個獨立建置框 並且要放大 讓我看清楚" (the status bar's small build bar)
- buildWatchTick's open / update / close go to a build window (WebviewPanel
  ht9045Designer.buildWindow, media/buildwin.js / .css, floated into its own
  window): the % in 80px type, a 32px bar, steps / total, the time, the file.
  Done = green "建置完成" and it closes by itself (buildWinCloseMs, 4 s); not
  finished = red with the errors, it stays; a writer gone silent = closed.
- 0152's status bar build item removed. ht9045Designer.build.window = false:
  VS Code's notification as before; build.newWindow = false: a tab beside.
- Notes: the user asked whether all of this is in one install package -- yes,
  dist\ht9045-html-designer-0.162.0.vsix; the three VS Code user settings are
  not in it; the version stays 0.162.0 (tools numbers tell builds apart).

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (extension 230: opened floated at the build start,
the % / steps / time sent, done closes, failed stays, no status item; panels:
the window in Edge -- 80px %, a 36px bar filled to 75%, 30 / 40 steps);
real VS Code 156/159 (the 3 known stale checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
